{meta title='Other tunings', about='The names before the lines tune the strings - D A D G B E from the bottom is drop D, so the low string sounds a D; tuning= names a tuning, here the ukulele with its high G on the bottom line.'/}
{tablature}
e|-----------------|
B|-----------------|
G|-----------------|
D|-------0---------|
A|-----0---0-------|
D|-0-0-------0-----|
{/tablature}
{tablature tuning='ukulele'}
A|-----0-----|
E|---0---0---|
C|-0-------0-|
G|-----------|
{/tablature}
